&TRACE OFF
&TYPE Hello &1, you gave &N args: &ARGSTRING
&X = 5
&Y = &X + 3 * 2
&TYPE Y is &Y
&I = 1
&LOOP 2 3
&V&I = item&I
&I = &I + 1
&TYPE V2 is &V2, V3 is &V3
&S = &CONCAT abc def &X
&L = &LENGTH &S
&TYPE concat &S length &L
&SUB = &SUBSTR &S 2 3
&TYPE substr &SUB
&P = &PIECE &ARGSTRING 2
&TYPE piece2 &P datatype &DATATYPE
&D = &DATATYPE &X
&TYPE datatype of X: &D
&IF &X > 3 &TYPE X is big
&IF &X = 4 &TYPE never
&CALL -SUB a b c
&TYPE back rc &RC args again &ARGSTRING
&STACK hello stack
&READ VARS &R1 &R2
&TYPE read &R1 / &R2
&BEGTYPE
Text with &X substituted
&END
&BEGTYPE ALL
Raw &X
&END
&ERROR &TYPE error rc &RC
STATE NOSUCH FILE A
&ERROR
&J = 0
-L1
&J = &J + 1
&IF &J < 3 &GOTO -L1
&TYPE J &J
&LOOP -E &J >= 5
&J = &J + 1
-E &TYPE in loop &J
&TYPE after loop &J
&UPPER VARS &S
&TYPE upper &S
&BEGSTACK
line one &X
line two
&END
&READ STRING &Q
&TYPE first stacked: &Q
&READ STRING &Q
&TYPE second stacked: &Q
CP QUERY TIME
&TYPE rc of echo &RC
&EXIT 7
-SUB
&TYPE in sub &N args: &1 &2 &3
&RETURN 3
